  "content": "\n\n<p>一款靈感來自樂高的 Minecraft 材質包！</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">高清版本已於我的 Gumroad 頁面提供：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminebricks.gumroad.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineBricks</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6yDXVxt8vCQ?ab_channel=macio6\" width=\"638\" height=\"375\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xdjyqap3Smw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EAgY0syV8BY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bjmez4a-Z8k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MineBricks 材質包將把您的世界變成極度逼真、閃亮、塑膠質感積木。完全免費！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>適用於<strong>Minecraft Java 版</strong>的積木資源包</h3>\n<h4><br><strong>安裝指南</strong><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EgL-V1-znuy32ADk4--ekxr4mONV29eW/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EgL-V1-znuy32ADk4--ekxr4mONV29eW/view?usp=sharing</a><br><br><strong>推薦設定與配置（安裝前請閱讀）：</strong></h4>\n<h4>建議使用<strong>SEUS PTGI (PTGI HRR)</strong>光影。需搭配 OptiFine。</h4>\n<p>您可以在此下載光影：<br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/45141775\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] SEUS PTGI HRR Test 2.1 | Patreon</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/download-seus-3-60268558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下載] SEUS PTGI HRR 3 | Patreon</a></p>\n<p><em>第 3 版效能可能較差。第 2.1 版在洞穴內可能會有一些視覺瑕疵。</em><br><em>進行路徑追蹤至少建議使用 RTX 2060 顯示卡。</em></p>\n<p><strong>必須使用此光影才能達成宣傳片中的寫實畫面效果！</strong></p>\n<p>也可搭配 Nostalgia 光影、Photon 光影、SEUS Renewed、Chocapic 光影（不含反射）、BSL 等使用。您也可以不使用光影遊玩，但畫質會較差。</p>\n<p>請在遊玩前套用以下設定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>選項 &gt; 影片設定 &gt; 詳細設定 &gt; 交替方塊必須開啟</strong></li>\n<li><strong>選項 &gt; 影片設定 &gt; 詳細設定 &gt; 樹木：精美或智慧</strong></li>\n<li><strong>選項 &gt; 影片設定 &gt; 詳細設定 &gt; 生物群落融合：關閉</strong></li>\n<li><strong>SEUS PTGI 光影設定 &gt; 光線追蹤設定 &gt; 幾何追蹤品質：0</strong></li>\n<li><strong>SEUS PTGI 光影設定 &gt; 選擇與材質包解析度相同的紋理解析度</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>實用教學：</strong></p>\n<p>如何安裝 OptiFine：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8kiHuVc4SY4&ab_channel=TheBreakdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8kiHuVc4SY4&amp;ab_channel=TheBreakdown</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://public-files.gumroad.com/q1r2fasv8m0su69azkxm4x1u7gy6\" alt=\"\" width=\"2561\" height=\"1441\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://public-files.gumroad.com/72bun421cwchxn04cze7urzjs4wm\" alt=\"\" width=\"2561\" height=\"1441\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://public-files.gumroad.com/vzpz0ydkswa01xlm5r4rr30pr6cw\" alt=\"\" width=\"2561\" height=\"1441\"></p>",
